<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on the FTSE index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on the FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 55 million American-style call and put warrants, in 11 equal tranches, on the FTSE index, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE FTSE INDEX IS CONTROLLED BY 100 WARRANTS.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	09.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	17.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON (TO APPLY)     MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4270</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	   4300 STG     0.82 STG</p>
<p> CALL	   4400 STG     0.40 STG</p>
<p> CALL	   4500 STG     0.20 STG</p>
<p> CALL	   4600 STG     0.08 STG</p>
<p> CALL	   4700 STG     0.04 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    3700 STG     0.06 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    3800 STG     0.09 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    3900 STG     0.13 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    4000 STG     0.21 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    4100 STG     0.36 STG</p>
<p> PUT	    4200 STG     0.59 STG</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    BZEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
